From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hmz007 <hmz007@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 20:26:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: rk3399: r4s: disable nodes for vopb/vopl

The NanoPi R4S has no display output, disable vopb and vopl to fix:
  rk3399_vop vop@ff8f0000: failed to get ahb reset (ret=-524)

Signed-off-by: hmz007 <hmz007@gmail.com>
[ported to U-Boot 2025.10: moved to rk3399-nanopi-r4s-u-boot.dtsi]
---
 arch/arm/dts/rk3399-nanopi-r4s-u-boot.dtsi | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm/dts/rk3399-nanopi-r4s-u-boot.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3399-nanopi-r4s-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -41,3 +41,19 @@
 	phy-supply = <&vdd_5v>;
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&vopb {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&vopb_mmu {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&vopl {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&vopl_mmu {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
